      "v": 6,
      "zh": "这些人所见的是虚假，是谎诈的占卜。他们说是耶和华说的，其实耶和华并没有差遣他们，他们倒使人指望那话必然立定。",
      "en": "They see delusion and their omens are a lie.[NOTE:1] They say, “The Lord declares,” though the Lord has not sent them;[NOTE:2] yet they expect their word to be confirmed.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "The same description of a false prophet is found in Micah 2:11.",
